Subject: [PATCH] Document full motor ID map and apply it to the follower
 config

11 shoulder rotation about z (shoulder_pan), 12 horizontal shoulder
rotation (shoulder_lift), 13 elbow (elbow_flex), 15 wrist (wrist_roll),
10 top gripper. README table, robot.yaml motor_ids, validation doc and
the motor-ID config test updated together.

